OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused tells jury he is   
OL,4,Anot homophobic                         
OL,6,FA 19-year-old accused of murdering a   
OL,7,Fman by pushing him into a marina has   
OL,8,Ftold his trial he is not homophobic.   
OL,10,FLayton Randle, 19, of Oakfield Terrace 
OL,11,FRoad, Plymouth, denies murdering Drew  
OL,12,FPerham at King Point Marina in Plymouth
OL,13,Fon 24 January.                         
OL,15,FPlymouth Crown Court heard Randle had  
OL,16,Fadmitted manslaughter and accepted he  
OL,17,Fattacked the 24-year-old and caused his
OL,18,Fdeath, but does not accept he intended 
OL,19,Fto kill or cause him really serious    
OL,20,Fharm.                                  
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
