OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused tells jury he is   
OL,4,Anot homophobic                         
OL,6,FWhen Randle was questioned about       
OL,7,Fdescribing Drew Perham in a homophobic 
OL,8,Fmanner on social media platform        
OL,9,FSnapchat, he said calling him a "gay   
OL,10,Fboy" was a "quick way to describe him".
OL,11,FLater, he told the jury: "Drew's       
OL,12,Fsexuality has nothing to do with this."
